# DRAGON: LightShowAnimation (ft:0x20) on outlane_kicker_light_group (4 TLight members,
# DRAGON.DAT attr 1027). part_tlight_tlightgroup G3 (0x40b3d1): the loop runs over count-1 lights,
# one rand() per light plus a second one when rand() % 100 > 70; the last member is never animated.
# Expected value: independent simulation of the MSVC LCG (state = state * 214013 + 2531011,
# value = bits 16..30) from state 3: the values % 100 are 48, 96, 94, 91, 31, 77, ...
# FT (3 lights tested): 48 no; 96 yes (+ the draw 94); 91 yes (+ the draw 31) -> 5 draws, the last
# draw (n_rand_last) is the 5th value, 7031. An ungated loop over all 4 lights would test 77 as well
# (yes, + 1 draw) and draw 7.
# Members in DRAGON.DAT attribute 1027 order: v_lite44, v_lite43, v_lite42, v_lite41. The last member
# (v_lite41) must stay untouched: it is turned off at frame 43, and the ungated loop would turn it on
# (bitmap 0) for the timed show at frame 45; FT leaves it at -1.
# Frame 45 is quiet: the same run without the message shows no other draw between frames 40 and 58
# (other groups' random light animations draw in bursts around frames 19, 39, 59, ...; they are
# counted because TLightGroup draws through ft_rand::Int()).
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch v_lite44.bitmap v_lite43.bitmap v_lite42.bitmap v_lite41.bitmap
43 msg v_lite41 TLightTurnOff 0
44 dump pre_msg
45 seed 3
45 msg outlane_kicker_light_group ft:0x20@TLightGroup 0.2
45 dump at_msg
46 dump after
45 expect n_rand_draws == 5 delta 44
46 expect n_rand_draws == 5 delta 44
46 expect n_rand_last == 7031
46 expect v_lite41.bitmap == -1
70 quit
